{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/8770-will-i-not-be-getting-my-kickstarter-books","id":8770,"title":"Will I not be getting my kickstarter books?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-12T06:50:18-08:00","id":8770,"title":"Will I not be getting my kickstarter books?","content":"I worried because I sent Rich my change of address, and he never got back to me and I sent it again and still no response. This worries me because they sent my Mummy book to the old Address and I only received it because coincidentally I was returning to the place with a rented van to retrieve my stuff when it was delivered. So I don't know if they changed the address to Hunter and Werewolf! I could not receive the books I spent a lot of money on.<br /> <br /> Does anyone else share my worries?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T09:51:17-08:00","id":8890,"title":"","content":"I'm not in the same boat (if I'm moving any time soon, I've got bigger issues than some gaming books going missing), but have you tried messaging Rich directly about it? He's busy and all, but it seems like you'll get farther contacting him through Kickstarter than a post here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T10:09:23-08:00","id":8916,"title":"","content":"As I have said yes, twice I have messaged him directly and no response. I moved two months ago and I sent my new address when I moved and then I sent it again over a month later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T10:17:26-08:00","id":8923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/8770-will-i-not-be-getting-my-kickstarter-books?p=8916#post8916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As I have said yes, twice I have messaged him directly and no response. I moved two months ago and I sent my new address when I moved and then I sent it again over a month later.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I'm not Rich I think I can calm you. I've made the experience that it takes time for him to react and sometimes he doesn't, but he then does what you asked for. <br /> Send him another message now and add that he should contact you ASAP. He has probably changed your address and never told you about it. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To a player who wanted his character to attend a very &quot;special&quot; school:<br /> There is no Charles F. Lupus school for gifted werewolves.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/971-arag","name":"Arag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar971_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T10:19:45-08:00","id":8925,"title":"","content":"You said you re-sent the address change. I meant more in the sense of trying to point out that the last address change didn't work. Given that he's been dealing with a lot of this sort of thing, he might not respond unless he knows there's a specific problem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T13:42:27-08:00","id":9121,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I had to change my address on W20 and Hunters Hunted 2. I'm a bit nervous since he never acknowledged the address change (unlike the other Kickstarters I backed before the move). It's actually a little bit comforting I'm not the only one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name"